{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "龍樹。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "勝怨。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "阿提沙。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "黑足。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "六卷。安慧。勘同元魏菩提流支譯《大寶積經》論。但作者缺名。"}
