{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "龍樹。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "一卷半。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "釋迦文。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "一卷半。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "世親。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "七十五卷。圓測。由漢本譯出。九品悉備。可補漢本之缺。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "八卷。地親。由漢本轉譯。但原本不詳。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "智吉祥賢。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "中國智金剛。似由漢本譯出，但原本不詳。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "三卷。慈氏。勘同唐波頗譯《大乘莊嚴論》本頌。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "慈氏。勘同唐玄奘譯《辨中邊論頌》。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "慈氏。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "慈氏。異本。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "慈氏。勘同元魏勒那摩提譯《究竟一乘寶性論》卷二以下本頌。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "無著。勘同元魏勒那摩提譯《究竟一乘寶性論》長行。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "約十一卷。世親。勘同唐波頗譯《大乘莊嚴經論》長行。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "二卷。世親。勘同唐玄奘譯《辨中邊論》。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "世親。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "十二卷。無性。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "安慧。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "利他賢。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "智吉祥。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "約十二卷。安慧。"}
